    {
      "name": "Bills",
      "description": "Everything that charges you on a schedule: rent, utilities, subscriptions, insurance. Amount is what each charge costs and Period how often it comes; Monthly cost turns any period into a monthly figure so bills compare. Keep Next due current after each payment, and set Cancel by for anything on a trial or a renewal you may not want.",
